# A Thief in Norg?! (battlefield.thief_in_norg): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Burning_Circle (arena 1's), in the battlefield:
# 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with
# 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event). BC_Entrance with the clearance and the charm kept: checkRequirements as
# no registrant fails: the handler returns nothing: the default.
lists WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrade WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/Burning_Circle/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/onEventUpdate/32003 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=SAM lvl=50
quest Outlands.ForgeYourDestiny completed
quest Outlands.TheSacredKatana completed
quest Outlands.YomiOkuri completed
quest Outlands.AThiefInNorg accepted
charvar Quest[5][142]Prog 6
item BanishingCharm
login
trade BC_Entrance BanishingCharm x1     # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=65                  # index 4, area 1: entered
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Burning_Circle                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Burning_Circle                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp -338.1,104.3,-260.3 WaughroonShrine
trigger BC_Entrance                     # the clearance, the charm kept: the default
